{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_04_2004_004yuk", "source_sha256": "c43374033a6b0357be813bb2e0610cd819920e119f3b9debec6c45bf59364a0a", "ja": "ち、チラリズム……！", "zh": "若、若即若离……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_04_2005_007ior", "source_sha256": "2a53f29ea94b96ce591fb2836152575775c240408e86fed0a24b849db5ca4e37", "ja": "なんか……いちいち刺さる気がするわ……。\nああいう標語、いつ考えてるのかしら。", "zh": "总觉得……每句话都一针见血呢……\n真不晓得她们是什么时候想出那种标语的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_04_2006_006mak", "source_sha256": "2cac168e7dc461fbc820c3447d31cfb849b85d1dd47dc02df25b8c4582020fc4", "ja": "このみ師匠、莉緒師匠、ありがとうございました！\n全部しっかりメモしました！！", "zh": "木实师父、莉绪师父，非常感谢你们！\n在下已经全都笔记下来了！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_04_2007_003mik", "source_sha256": "672a5b77f96dbf9b29a07329375429dc85bc5414d6c4ad579e9c32f415e0a9f8", "ja": "ミキからも、ありがとうなの！\n真くんのメモを見ながら、がんばるね♪", "zh": "美希也要谢谢你们！\n美希会看着阿真的笔记，好好努力的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_04_2008_046rio", "source_sha256": "5e45989ee745b803590cbf53e05faccf77756c2b9975fca37fd7292cacc0a17d", "ja": "どういたしまして！　困った時はお互いさま。\n今度、私の相談にも乗ってね♪", "zh": "不客气！碰到困难时就该互相帮助嘛。\n下次我有烦恼时，也要听我倾诉喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
